[8785]={["aftermath"]="Shai planned a special concoction she expected the insects to dislike.",["atomIDs"]={"8785:description:1-74","8785:description:77-180","8785:description:183-243","8785:objective:1-122","8785:objective:125-203"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8785:completion:1-8","8785:completion:10-28","8785:completion:30-70","8785:completion:72-106"},["opening"]="The Legion's performance led the Hold to prioritize its unusual request. Shai required potent mojo and immolation oil at the southern post.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to supply the mojo, flasks, oil and briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Shai's ingredients.",["sourceHash"]="b53b8314b1f0a3dd495d157b14635c578b99a673012bc161b03a5505cdd7c692",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8786]={["aftermath"]="Merok confirmed the shortage the delivery addressed.",["atomIDs"]={"8786:description:1-116","8786:description:119-212","8786:objective:1-97","8786:objective:100-178"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8786:completion:1-15","8786:completion:17-53"},["opening"]="The Legion's weapon request exceeded what the Hold could immediately provide. Three massive iron axes needed another source before Merok could receive them.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring the axes and logistics document.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied the Legion's additional weapons.",["sourceHash"]="306018c267da5628298a2263682394c9851a7bd3568df61124b33f389448e0be",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8787]={["aftermath"]="Merok planned to distribute the materials among the troops.",["atomIDs"]={"8787:description:1-93","8787:description:96-154","8787:description:157-267","8787:objective:1-85","8787:objective:88-167"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8787:completion:1-10","8787:completion:12-53","8787:completion:55-86"},["opening"]="The Legion's armor kits had somehow vanished in transit. Replacement stock was needed at Merok's camp so its volunteers could continue supporting the common cause.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver eight heavy and eight rugged kits with the briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} restored the requested kit supply.",["sourceHash"]="6d8c7062a9f1690c43a7b21d340dc1102654dd2e1e695976a3dc704b20ca015a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8789]={["atomIDs"]={"8789:description:1-45","8789:description:50-136","8789:description:138-208","8789:description:210-261","8789:description:266-339","8789:description:344-499","8789:objective:1-151"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8789:completion:1-102"},["opening"]="Arygos has watched Qiraji treachery for a millennium and believes their weaknesses can be used against them. Imperial armaments combined with three Elementium Ore are his proposed means.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring Arygos the armaments and Elementium.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied the armament-infusion materials.",["sourceHash"]="68f7d6f4948ea0d2b06af02227cf78dfdac849e6d5c44537c156149ab86b9f5f",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8790]={["atomIDs"]={"8790:description:1-160","8790:description:162-191","8790:description:196-301","8790:objective:1-164"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8790:completion:1-22","8790:completion:24-94"},["opening"]="Merithra describes Arygos's theory that Elementium can be deadly to the Old Gods and their servants. Imperial regalia and three ores can be used in her proposed weapon infusion.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring Merithra the regalia and Elementium.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Merithra's infusion requirements.",["sourceHash"]="b424af6d64eefe2605ccc1a991aed184f2e59427c16147458f63972ae9d78d21",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8791]={["atomIDs"]={"8791:description:1-40","8791:description:42-80","8791:description:85-151","8791:description:153-228","8791:objective:1-95"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8791:completion:1-76","8791:completion:78-130"},["opening"]="Ossirian has already fallen when the head is taken. The task is to carry evidence of that victory to Commander Mar'alith so its news can reach beyond the ruins.",["pending"]="{actor} would deliver Ossirian's head to Mar'alith.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the head at Cenarion Hold.",["sourceHash"]="06676d39fa8369c6ce48f218a47ed445d60c994be043c1211bdd5c7d85b86a74",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8792]={["atomIDs"]={"8792:description:1-51","8792:description:53-166","8792:description:168-342","8792:description:347-406","8792:description:408-427","8792:description:429-474","8792:objective:1-60"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8792:completion:1-13","8792:completion:15-158","8792:completion:160-283","8792:completion:288-436"},["opening"]="Taiga asks for help with the Horde's Ahn'Qiraj preparations. Official collectors are working already, but their goals still depend on volunteers reporting to Warlord Gorchuk.",["pending"]="{actor} would meet Gorchuk in the Valley of Spirits.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} answered Taiga's referral to Gorchuk.",["sourceHash"]="d391a925c4cf8736e80510b444b3c7fad644e5106f52fd500929db53ff9f5e62",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8793]={["atomIDs"]={"8793:description:1-51","8793:description:53-166","8793:description:168-342","8793:description:347-406","8793:description:408-427","8793:description:429-474","8793:objective:1-60"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8793:completion:1-13","8793:completion:15-158","8793:completion:160-283","8793:completion:288-436"},["opening"]="Grimsford directs a willing contributor toward the Horde's war collection. Gorchuk oversees the effort in Orgrimmar, where more assistance is needed before the campaign.",["pending"]="{actor} would speak with Gorchuk about the preparations.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} followed Grimsford's referral to the warlord.",["sourceHash"]="b0108c4cd29ff9e758334f1ebd196f099c01a1d25289b445d76423a8527a8f92",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8794]={["atomIDs"]={"8794:description:1-51","8794:description:53-166","8794:description:168-342","8794:description:347-406","8794:description:408-427","8794:description:429-474","8794:objective:1-60"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8794:completion:1-13","8794:completion:15-158","8794:completion:160-283","8794:completion:288-436"},["opening"]="Kai'jin's appeal concerns the supplies still missing for Ahn'Qiraj. He sends the volunteer to Gorchuk rather than assigning one particular material himself.",["pending"]="{actor} would report to Gorchuk in Orgrimmar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Kai'jin's referral.",["sourceHash"]="66e4ec57e7df5c7af37c5f5121a212156712e654fea555ade322e97c0e48063b",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8795]={["atomIDs"]={"8795:description:1-51","8795:description:53-169","8795:description:171-345","8795:description:350-416","8795:description:418-437","8795:description:439-484","8795:objective:1-63"},["editorialNotes"]="Alliance referral has Horde Gorchuk completion speech. Only coherent acceptance and personal objective fulfillment are authored; unrelated completion text is excluded.",["editorialVersion"]=2,["opening"]="Fizzlebolt calls for volunteers to support the Alliance's Ahn'Qiraj preparations. Field Marshal Snowfall is the officer to consult while collectors continue gathering materials.",["pending"]="{actor} would meet Snowfall in Ironforge's Military Ward.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} followed Fizzlebolt's referral to Snowfall.",["sourceHash"]="e4c11b7be1d4f5b1100bb3797558e5ca6fa9505c06c02c446f8baa7f93a8806e",["sourceStageStatus"]="SOURCE_CONFLICT_COMPLETION_UNRELATED",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8796]={["atomIDs"]={"8796:description:1-51","8796:description:53-169","8796:description:171-345","8796:description:350-416","8796:description:418-437","8796:description:439-484","8796:objective:1-63"},["editorialNotes"]="Alliance referral has Horde Gorchuk completion speech. Only coherent acceptance and personal objective fulfillment are authored; unrelated completion text is excluded.",["editorialVersion"]=2,["opening"]="Maclure asks a prospective contributor to help the Alliance meet its war-supply goals. Snowfall oversees the preparations and can direct that offer of service.",["pending"]="{actor} would speak with Snowfall in Ironforge.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Maclure's referral.",["sourceHash"]="6467e101a352fad61d650d158a1a1f2afab8ce7047e714075d46367323119675",["sourceStageStatus"]="SOURCE_CONFLICT_COMPLETION_UNRELATED",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8797]={["atomIDs"]={"8797:description:1-51","8797:description:53-169","8797:description:171-345","8797:description:350-416","8797:description:418-437","8797:description:439-484","8797:objective:1-63"},["editorialNotes"]="Alliance referral has Horde Gorchuk completion speech. Only coherent acceptance and personal objective fulfillment are authored; unrelated completion text is excluded.",["editorialVersion"]=2,["opening"]="Moonshadow points volunteers toward Snowfall while the Alliance's collection remains in progress. Hearing the appeal is only the beginning of helping prepare for Ahn'Qiraj.",["pending"]="{actor} would report to Snowfall in the Military Ward.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} answered Moonshadow's call to meet the field marshal.",["sourceHash"]="e971c9fe6fcfb92313558c6ced2c67f3917668205c190087351f041d51b8e9d6",["sourceStageStatus"]="SOURCE_CONFLICT_COMPLETION_UNRELATED",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8799]={["atomIDs"]={"8799:description:1-9","8799:description:11-105","8799:description:110-182","8799:description:185-245","8799:description:248-283","8799:description:285-314","8799:description:319-383","8799:description:386-455","8799:description:458-505","8799:objective:1-117"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8799:completion:1-86","8799:completion:88-189","8799:completion:191-247"},["opening"]="Kaymard offers a master cook access to the holly-preserving machine. Deeprock Salt and five gold are its stated price for a batch that will outlast the fresh holiday greens.",["pending"]="{actor} would supply the salt and payment at the preserver.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the holly-preservation transaction.",["sourceHash"]="cd01f7c600c0d206281a555aef401aa9b7dcca1de5f4d6b7df4f478558f05c39",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8800]={["atomIDs"]={"8800:description:1-99","8800:description:102-149","8800:description:151-225","8800:objective:1-44"},["opening"]="Kaldon directed successful volunteers toward the smith who handled equipment exchanges. Their badges would demonstrate levels of service rather than exist only as decorations.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to show Vargus the earned badges.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Vargus about the equipment.",["sourceHash"]="54059c2dd0b0f19b8c71e3b03e3ba80e69a4a4af8c5e253770ed98f0c92148c8",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8801]={["atomIDs"]={"8801:description:1-31","8801:description:33-97","8801:description:102-183","8801:description:185-250","8801:description:255-302","8801:description:307-376","8801:description:381-438","8801:objective:1-65"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8801:completion:1-114","8801:completion:116-158"},["opening"]="C'Thun has already been destroyed when an eye is taken from the remains. Even the fallen creature radiates a disturbing legacy, and the dragons in the next chamber should see the evidence.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring C'Thun's eye to Caelestrasz.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the eye to the waiting dragon.",["sourceHash"]="c6becb53713bc0953c28eee86ab5a04f023b5db55609fe9ba63e954698cada37",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8802]={["aftermath"]="Anachronos offered a choice from an ancient cache of artifacts spanning thousands of years.",["atomIDs"]={"8802:description:1-48","8802:description:50-79","8802:description:81-174","8802:objective:1-60"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8802:completion:1-44","8802:completion:46-146"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Carry C'Thun's eye to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",["opening"]="C'Thun's recovered eye was to join a collection guarded through the ages. Anachronos awaited it at the Caverns of Time, giving the trophy a destination beyond the battlefield where it had been won.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring the eye to Anachronos.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered C'Thun's eye to Anachronos.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="e7576863ec1b987705e00756dbe591208e444906e2ee334c59942b405caaefe4",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8804]={["atomIDs"]={"8804:description:1-106","8804:description:109-213","8804:description:216-317","8804:objective:1-131","8804:objective:134-211"},["opening"]="Keeping newly arrived volunteers alive required practical supplies before further service. This kit request combined water, antivenom and desert food at Calandrath's inn.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring four of each kit material and its briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the survival requisition.",["sourceHash"]="52509c10227e47126b931dccfbd586f7c84edddb62bf36ab79043745c73d5da7",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8805]={["atomIDs"]={"8805:description:1-91","8805:description:94-177","8805:objective:1-94","8805:objective:97-175"},["opening"]="Another guard request identified a shortage in the mounted division. Kozus needed three ornate mithril boots under the second logistics briefing.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to provide the requested footwear and document.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the mounted guard's boot order.",["sourceHash"]="c7f403b959940a56b30564ca276b4178e4f956c21a7fbab446e9c2ee4a4031db",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8806]={["atomIDs"]={"8806:description:1-62","8806:description:65-148","8806:objective:1-151","8806:objective:154-233"},["opening"]="Three grades of grinding stone were requested for the Hold's guards. Ten of each would replenish the working supply through Kozus's logistics channel.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring the heavy, solid and dense stones with the briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the grinding-stone delivery.",["sourceHash"]="d2de5f9cdd76ba3af6a92baa9d62bf0f93a9fb1709a6ae20a8de2cc03cbde6e3",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8807]={["atomIDs"]={"8807:description:1-98","8807:description:101-172","8807:description:177-277","8807:objective:1-124","8807:objective:127-204"},["opening"]="Scrying work at the Hold depended on three different precious stones. The renewed request sent them directly to Larksbane with the numbered logistics paper.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring the shard pair and emerald with the briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the scrying supply task.",["sourceHash"]="722bb485d3e399ec5b536c1e0cc79a177defb8b5f3f888154349e64da8a1985c",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8808]={["atomIDs"]={"8808:description:1-66","8808:description:69-144","8808:objective:1-119","8808:objective:122-202"},["opening"]="More uniforms were needed as the volunteers arrived. Proudhorn's request again matched cloth, bolts and silk to the materials rather than a finished garment.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to supply the three uniform materials and briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the required cloth goods.",["sourceHash"]="03f564c68b6fcdf87e1ec2f49f52f4cf0c8c986f629758c64463c94d0e57ffd0",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8809]={["atomIDs"]={"8809:description:1-132","8809:description:135-245","8809:objective:1-94","8809:objective:97-175"},["opening"]="The smith's ability to arm the Hold depended on magical stock as well as ordinary metal. Enchanted thorium and leather were the specific materials requested here.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring two of each material and the logistics paper.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Vargus's enchanted stock.",["sourceHash"]="2bcb31dcb6cd1db8fc454bf86b7699ffdfecff140548a37efe4390a8bca88f65",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8810]={["atomIDs"]={"8810:description:1-114","8810:description:117-211","8810:objective:1-143","8810:objective:146-223"},["opening"]="Casualties had pushed first-aid stores dangerously low. This written order required equal batches of heavy silk, mageweave and runecloth bandages at the Hold.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to deliver thirty of each bandage and the briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the first-aid supply task.",["sourceHash"]="d7d12695d3857bbe5c8791bc5aee39db75d0d5ead318a07d53e418a53b1f3b77",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
