[8856]={["atomIDs"]={"8856:description:1-106","8856:description:109-213","8856:description:216-317","8856:objective:1-120"},["opening"]="The recruits' survival problem also produced a kit using baked fish instead of desert dumplings. The preserved request called for water and antivenom beside the food, with delivery still due to Calandrath.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to supply four water, four antivenom and four salmon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the fish-based kit request.",["sourceHash"]="6ba378e6a88beeabf13330437b0c4fb3edd0c7e1f5b0861635e66e0223adc7ff",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8857]={["aftermath"]="Oglethorpe imagined new mechanical chickens built from the material.",["atomIDs"]={"8857:description:1-148","8857:description:150-217","8857:description:219-265","8857:description:267-305","8857:objective:1-70"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8857:completion:1-53","8857:completion:55-81"},["opening"]="Nestor needed a fresh husk delivered rather than another expedition to the dangerous corpse. One of his collected samples could reach Oglethorpe before decay made it useless.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to carry the Ashi sample quickly.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the husk to Oglethorpe.",["sourceHash"]="c2be9e3fb929a48420a07a09ff1c67d7bcc1e30fe972bb2fb6451587c61adaca",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8858]={["aftermath"]="Oilfist anticipated powerful armor devised from the chitin.",["atomIDs"]={"8858:description:1-88","8858:description:90-159","8858:description:161-230","8858:description:235-293","8858:description:295-310","8858:description:315-362","8858:objective:1-71"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8858:completion:1-10","8858:completion:12-82","8858:completion:84-119"},["opening"]="Eazel remained occupied taking samples from the huge fallen insect. Oilfist had offered payment for a fresh portion in the Gorge, making speed the courier's contribution to the research.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the Regal sample to Oilfist.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the husk at Thorium Point.",["sourceHash"]="27fdaa2bd99349d5b8664c50c325c6c2109bd376c182b677ef9690bbcebdcb35",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8859]={["aftermath"]="Tyrosus confirmed its arrival was timely.",["atomIDs"]={"8859:description:1-71","8859:description:73-98","8859:description:100-155","8859:description:157-247","8859:description:252-275","8859:description:277-292","8859:description:294-349","8859:objective:1-107"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8859:completion:1-21","8859:completion:23-45"},["opening"]="Sophia's servants had nearly died recovering the sample. Tyrosus hoped its secrets could aid the war against the Scourge, so its freshness made immediate delivery important.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring the Zora husk to Tyrosus.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the sample at Light's Hope.",["sourceHash"]="cd0ea7b66e176077be7beb493e8543aff3c682646b5b7c2ac9f985320a770d81",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8860]={["aftermath"]="Allison thanked the courier and invited a share in the dancing and festivities outside.",["atomIDs"]={"8860:description:1-52","8860:description:55-141","8860:description:144-170","8860:description:172-242","8860:description:247-365","8860:description:368-404","8860:description:409-419","8860:description:422-497","8860:objective:1-63"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8860:completion:1-26","8860:completion:28-36","8860:completion:38-104","8860:completion:109-122","8860:completion:124-214"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Deliver Smokywood supplies to Allison at the Gilded Rose.",["opening"]="Stormwind's new-year revelers needed feeding as well as drink and fireworks. Allison awaited Smokywood's shipment at the Gilded Rose, making a delivery part of preparing the city for its celebration.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring the provisions to Allison.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the supplies to the Gilded Rose.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="03413e699e7fa71c90cc7096a83a5e32dbddc037f7d83774642af70c26c619fc",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8861]={["aftermath"]="Pala offered payment and encouraged the courier to join the dancing and drinking.",["atomIDs"]={"8861:description:1-56","8861:description:59-140","8861:description:145-171","8861:description:173-243","8861:description:248-367","8861:description:370-406","8861:description:411-421","8861:description:424-485","8861:objective:1-64"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8861:completion:1-14","8861:completion:16-92","8861:completion:97-112","8861:completion:114-132","8861:completion:134-160","8861:completion:162-268"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Deliver Smokywood supplies to Pala in Thunder Bluff.",["opening"]="Thunder Bluff's gathering promised drink and fireworks, but Pala also needed food for the people arriving to celebrate. The provisions were bound for the inn near the bridge to Hunter Rise.",["pending"]="{actor} would carry the supplies to Pala.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the provisions to Pala's inn.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="4d1f98c8719f663832cb16986d065c168348bfd0030b2011d48b2e7f6eaca447",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8867]={["aftermath"]="The harbinger offered an invitation that could carry its bearer to Moonglade from the greater moonlight.",["atomIDs"]={"8867:description:1-103","8867:description:108-190","8867:description:192-207","8867:description:212-282","8867:description:285-332","8867:objective:1-110"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8867:completion:1-14","8867:completion:19-123","8867:completion:128-194","8867:completion:197-242","8867:completion:244-258","8867:completion:263-375"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Launch eight lunar rockets and two clusters, then return to the harbinger.",["opening"]="Moonglade's druids marked an ancient victory with respect for elders, feasting and fireworks. Trying the launchers offered visitors a part in that shared celebration before traveling to the main gathering.",["pending"]="{actor} would launch the requested festival fireworks.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} launched the rockets and clusters and returned to the harbinger.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="8150823e0a49cc1f9be9755c267f1ba47c6e9ab02f369d3e73d15d19cfd325c6",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8868]={["aftermath"]="Valadar said the blessed beast could not truly die: the victory returned his spirit to the lake and granted another year's peace.",["atomIDs"]={"8868:description:1-45","8868:description:48-179","8868:description:182-274","8868:description:279-364","8868:description:367-417","8868:description:422-478","8868:description:481-507","8868:objective:1-50","8868:objective:53-92"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8868:completion:1-19","8868:completion:22-84","8868:completion:87-192","8868:completion:197-352"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Summon Omen, defeat him and return with Elune's blessing.",["opening"]="Omen had fought beside heroes in the ancient war before demonic magic turned him against his allies. Defeated in Moonglade, the great wolf slept beneath Elune'ara until each festival stirred him, requiring another effort to quiet his rage.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather allies to confront Omen.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} defeated Omen and returned with the blessing to Valadar.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="a0c8822f1860b70c39a85b50c06518052543c629fa947f4f7b85fcd4b5100a7d",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
