[8883]={["aftermath"]="Valadar welcomed the visitor, explaining that the normally secluded village opened its arms during the festival.",["atomIDs"]={"8883:description:1-78","8883:description:81-239","8883:description:244-377","8883:objective:1-75","8883:objective:77-134"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8883:completion:1-54","8883:completion:57-208","8883:completion:213-282"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Use the invitation in the moonlight and speak with Valadar in Nighthaven.",["opening"]="The festival invitation opened the way to Moonglade, where Valadar and Fariel received the celebrants. Their secluded village would make room for visitors drawn by the gathering's stories and prizes.",["pending"]="{actor} would travel to Nighthaven with the invitation.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Valadar Starsong in Nighthaven.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="3892d56311ab2750611e902fb85eb4c80532a2b476a0f11f754b0a8478861ab9",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8897]={["aftermath"]="Colara was touched by his first gift and briefly imagined taking his name, then checked her own haste.",["atomIDs"]={"8897:description:1-93","8897:description:95-173","8897:description:175-252","8897:description:257-287","8897:description:289-323","8897:description:325-343","8897:description:348-390","8897:description:392-461","8897:objective:1-96"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8897:completion:1-21","8897:completion:23-73","8897:completion:75-110","8897:completion:115-129","8897:completion:131-160","8897:completion:162-197","8897:completion:199-208"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Carry Heldric's note to Colara outside Stormwind's bank.",["opening"]="Gate duty left Heldric little time with Colara, while his modest pay and the possibility of deployment fed his fear of losing her. A carefully written note offered a way to speak when he could not leave his post.",["pending"]="{actor} would deliver Heldric's note to Colara.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} placed Heldric's note in Colara's hands.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="81f42bde3cd3ad3eb69c6d44efafec79ac6309fe89d39e7dc4f871386d865161",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8898]={["aftermath"]="Colara remembered Tormek's beard and smile and was surprised that he still thought of her.",["atomIDs"]={"8898:description:1-71","8898:description:73-96","8898:description:98-134","8898:description:136-202","8898:description:207-269","8898:description:274-319","8898:objective:1-72"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8898:completion:1-7","8898:completion:9-34","8898:completion:36-82","8898:completion:87-123"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring the creased letter to Colara in Stormwind.",["opening"]="A visit on bank business had left Tormek unable to forget Colara. After repeatedly rewriting his letter, he sought a courier he could trust more than the crowded mail to deliver it.",["pending"]="{actor} would carry Tormek's letter to Colara.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the creased letter to Colara.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="d47104c0630f449c57af86c7973f331627dd4dd9f33681470cdb1930591ec8b6",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8899]={["aftermath"]="Colara received the unfamiliar kind of gift with delight.",["atomIDs"]={"8899:description:1-27","8899:description:29-75","8899:description:80-139","8899:description:144-179","8899:description:181-229","8899:description:231-303","8899:objective:1-75"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8899:completion:1-47","8899:completion:49-59"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Deliver the immaculate letter to Colara outside the bank.",["opening"]="An admirer accustomed to centuries of words found none adequate for Colara's beauty. Fear that another suitor would capture her attention finally overcame the wish to perfect the letter.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring the admirer's letter to Colara.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the immaculate letter.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="6f2770ab13ea7b77a205e793b33df44faadf376561a334fc9515a82abbf4f3b0",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8900]={["aftermath"]="Elenia admired the orc's eloquence and reflected on how little chance their peoples had previously had to know one another.",["atomIDs"]={"8900:description:1-15","8900:description:17-60","8900:description:62-99","8900:description:104-152","8900:description:154-227","8900:description:232-307","8900:description:309-323","8900:description:325-363","8900:description:365-401","8900:objective:1-82"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8900:completion:1-45","8900:completion:47-110","8900:completion:112-145"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Take the slightly creased note to Elenia in the Undercity.",["opening"]="A conversation with Elenia had offered an understanding the sender found nowhere else. Mockery from companions had ended their meetings, but longing now prompted a letter intended for her own hands.",["pending"]="{actor} would carry the note to Elenia.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the slightly creased note to Elenia.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="f3c6ab62eeea2a54d4bf458434ae4a5c44e792eb1bd8873cd5475461f5d5966b",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8901]={["aftermath"]="Elenia was moved but could not imagine accepting a tauren's love. She was relieved not to have to break his heart in person.",["atomIDs"]={"8901:description:1-36","8901:description:38-125","8901:description:127-218","8901:description:223-282","8901:description:287-332","8901:description:334-368","8901:description:370-398","8901:objective:1-85"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8901:completion:1-36","8901:completion:38-111","8901:completion:113-160","8901:completion:165-232","8901:completion:234-269"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring Temma's letter to Elenia near the Undercity's bank.",["opening"]="Temma's love for a Forsaken woman crossed a boundary he knew was unusual among his people. He hoped a letter inviting Elenia to Mulgore might bring her into his life despite those differences.",["pending"]="{actor} would carry Temma's invitation to Elenia.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Temma's carefully written letter.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="688da989e4d39ce584bf7794c03f4d8b3b23eade9237e4f1c34f9cff6a53678a",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8902]={["aftermath"]="Elenia remembered the wedding, home and retirement they had once imagined, but feared her former beloved would now see only her dead flesh.",["atomIDs"]={"8902:description:1-73","8902:description:75-171","8902:description:176-280","8902:description:285-315","8902:description:317-358","8902:description:360-397","8902:objective:1-85"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8902:completion:1-50","8902:completion:52-62","8902:completion:64-102","8902:completion:104-168","8902:completion:170-216","8902:completion:221-240","8902:completion:245-301","8902:completion:303-337"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Deliver the lovingly composed letter to Elenia.",["opening"]="Elenia's childhood betrothed hoped their former love might survive everything that had changed them. Too anxious to approach her himself, he entrusted a letter to someone willing to carry it.",["pending"]="{actor} would take the letter to Elenia.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the letter to Elenia in the Undercity.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="fd015e1ed6f0d02d34d72ca628ea71dacff66cf6dd6ae83109ab3a97270d416f",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8903]={["aftermath"]="The card confirmed Aristan's suspicion that the behavior had reached the watch, leaving him searching for its cause.",["atomIDs"]={"8903:description:1-56","8903:description:58-167","8903:description:172-248","8903:description:250-272","8903:description:277-372","8903:objective:1-74"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8903:completion:1-14","8903:completion:16-36","8903:completion:38-66","8903:completion:68-93","8903:completion:95-129"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring Aristan a card from a Stormwind guard.",["opening"]="Aristan regarded the city's sudden infatuation as unnatural and potentially dangerous. If the guards had neglected their duty as well, the strange affection might threaten the Alliance's defenses rather than remain a harmless fashion.",["pending"]="{actor} would find whether the guards shared the affliction.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Aristan a Stormwind guard's card.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="9b3d5dd69c0ca265aef329dffdd8d5129d09681ef7e03d52f4c65c2999ee31f6",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8904]={["aftermath"]="Fenstad accepted the evidence and began considering an explanation for the unexpected change.",["atomIDs"]={"8904:description:1-56","8904:description:58-143","8904:description:148-232","8904:description:234-323","8904:description:328-407","8904:objective:1-76"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8904:completion:1-14","8904:completion:16-36","8904:completion:38-66","8904:completion:68-93","8904:completion:95-129"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring Fenstad a guardian's moldy card.",["opening"]="Fenstad feared that the Undercity's guardians had succumbed to the same strange affection overtaking its people. Testing that suspicion mattered because the city's defenders were expected to resist such distractions.",["pending"]="{actor} would investigate the guardians' behavior.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned a guardian's card to Fenstad.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="e4a242b8f3c6420138cc80cb19f0debb22f4dd457bc99834951ab33b22ce9592",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8905]={["atomIDs"]={"8905:description:1-13","8905:description:16-54","8905:description:59-176","8905:description:179-262","8905:description:267-375","8905:description:378-460","8905:description:463-505","8905:objective:1-127"},["opening"]="Deliana offered better arm protection in return for Wildheart bracers. The bargain also called for fifteen samples of blood from Winterspring's bears and frostsabers, whose properties she needed, and twenty gold.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Wildheart Bracers, fifteen Winterspring Blood Samples and twenty gold to Deliana.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Deliana's Wildheart Bracers, blood-sample and twenty-gold turn-in.",["sourceClassMask"]="1024",["sourceHash"]="93bbd7745895a292ce800a452587c46b146c723cd07a111f788519404f890acf",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8906]={["atomIDs"]={"8906:description:1-13","8906:description:16-54","8906:description:59-176","8906:description:179-262","8906:description:267-375","8906:description:378-460","8906:description:463-505","8906:objective:1-133"},["opening"]="Winterspring blood was Deliana's requested favor, not merely a price for the new armor she held. A hunter's Beaststalker bindings and twenty gold joined the fifteen specimens in her proposed exchange.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to supply Beaststalker's Bindings, fifteen Winterspring Blood Samples and twenty gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Beaststalker's Bindings, fifteen blood samples and twenty gold to Deliana.",["sourceClassMask"]="4",["sourceHash"]="95f733af2fbe7eb3392eaecb78f74d0eb12ab5510b369bb87d44d12b30ed59e2",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8907]={["atomIDs"]={"8907:description:1-13","8907:description:16-54","8907:description:59-176","8907:description:179-262","8907:description:267-375","8907:description:378-460","8907:description:463-505","8907:objective:1-129"},["opening"]="The Magister bindings could be replaced by a finer piece in Deliana's possession. Her terms extended beyond the old armor to bear and frostsaber blood from Winterspring, with gold also required.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring Magister's Bindings, fifteen Winterspring Blood Samples and twenty gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled Deliana's Magister's Bindings, fifteen-sample and twenty-gold exchange.",["sourceClassMask"]="128",["sourceHash"]="ce1414d9be22aa4bcb40148385b0480081d6b2082cd5d8126d52680acdb1f454",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8908]={["atomIDs"]={"8908:description:1-13","8908:description:16-54","8908:description:59-176","8908:description:179-262","8908:description:267-375","8908:description:378-460","8908:description:463-505","8908:objective:1-128"},["opening"]="Deliana set a small northern expedition behind her offer of improved Lightforge bracers. Fifteen Winterspring blood samples were the favor, while the existing bracers and twenty gold completed the bargain.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to obtain fifteen Winterspring Blood Samples and bring Lightforge Bracers and twenty gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Deliana's turn-in of Lightforge Bracers, fifteen blood samples and twenty gold.",["sourceClassMask"]="2",["sourceHash"]="35ca2887b6d02c48275f6f1f53bc06804accecfaef571e1f8129d8982d03e434",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8909]={["atomIDs"]={"8909:description:1-13","8909:description:16-54","8909:description:59-176","8909:description:179-262","8909:description:267-375","8909:description:378-460","8909:description:463-505","8909:objective:1-124"},["opening"]="A set of Devout bracers was the ordinary armor Deliana wanted exchanged. Her own need concerned the properties in Winterspring animals' blood, making the promised improvement depend on both a collection and payment.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to deliver Devout Bracers, fifteen Winterspring Blood Samples and twenty gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Deliana with Devout Bracers, fifteen blood samples and twenty gold.",["sourceClassMask"]="16",["sourceHash"]="e532d54eef7ab04b60ef8e78557bb1375bf203f1efcbb9ecc8eb27e64ca6a1ea",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8910]={["atomIDs"]={"8910:description:1-13","8910:description:16-54","8910:description:59-176","8910:description:179-262","8910:description:267-375","8910:description:378-460","8910:description:463-505","8910:objective:1-129"},["opening"]="Shadowcraft bracers opened another version of Deliana's offer. She requested twenty gold and fifteen blood samples from the northern bears and cats before replacing the old arm protection with something better.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring Shadowcraft Bracers, fifteen Winterspring Blood Samples and twenty gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Shadowcraft Bracers exchange with the required samples and gold.",["sourceClassMask"]="8",["sourceHash"]="268ebedf1ab6762c8a6ef4bd9d5eb186a162bb56ddd35d4b446b9f9e0586cbca",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8911]={["atomIDs"]={"8911:description:1-13","8911:description:16-54","8911:description:59-176","8911:description:179-262","8911:description:267-375","8911:description:378-460","8911:description:463-505","8911:objective:1-127"},["opening"]="Deliana's proposed trade reached Dreadmist bracers, but its research material lay far from Ironforge. Winterspring's beasts supplied the fifteen blood samples she sought beside the old garment and fee.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to obtain the fifteen blood samples and deliver Dreadmist Bracers with twenty gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Dreadmist Bracers, fifteen Winterspring Blood Samples and twenty gold to Deliana.",["sourceClassMask"]="256",["sourceHash"]="b27f680a43c45e862e7f9cfb2c615b18671c53f02c76b857538d85cab44c187e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8912]={["atomIDs"]={"8912:description:1-13","8912:description:16-54","8912:description:59-176","8912:description:179-262","8912:description:267-375","8912:description:378-460","8912:description:463-505","8912:objective:1-126"},["opening"]="The replacement Deliana offered for Valor bracers was tied to a favor in Winterspring. Blood from its frostsabers and bears, fifteen samples in all, accompanied the bracers and twenty-gold payment.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring Bracers of Valor, fifteen Winterspring Blood Samples and twenty gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the Bracers of Valor turn-in with Deliana's requested samples and gold.",["sourceClassMask"]="1",["sourceHash"]="b300f759c8d3908b933248a672c1d58ae6c5158539cf08ea90d3ea348e82ae11",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8913]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar expected Mux to welcome the samples. He also revealed that the bracers belonged to a larger set he might exchange for further assistance.",["atomIDs"]={"8913:description:1-9","8913:description:12-84","8913:description:87-155","8913:description:160-258","8913:description:263-363","8913:description:366-440","8913:objective:1-122"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8913:completion:1-8","8913:completion:10-43","8913:completion:48-93","8913:completion:95-211"},["opening"]="Mokvar offered an unusual pair of bracers in exchange for Wildheart armor, coin, and venom from Silithus. His bargain began with spiders and scorpions far from Orgrimmar.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather fifteen venom samples and bring the Wildheart Bracers and twenty gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Mokvar with the venom, gold, and Wildheart Bracers.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="0986cfd740a485c21b13d6741ea1f78f558f7f2ebe3cd85fec57b2ab8fe64265",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8914]={["aftermath"]="The delivery pleased Mokvar, who expected it to please Mux as well. More pieces of the armor set remained available if the arrangement continued.",["atomIDs"]={"8914:description:1-9","8914:description:12-84","8914:description:87-155","8914:description:160-258","8914:description:263-363","8914:description:366-440","8914:objective:1-128"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8914:completion:1-8","8914:completion:10-43","8914:completion:48-94","8914:completion:96-212"},["opening"]="A pair of Beaststalker's Bindings could open a trade with Mokvar. Alongside the old armor, he needed a substantial sample of Silithus venom and payment in gold.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to collect the venom and take the bindings and payment to Mokvar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought fifteen venom samples, twenty gold, and Beaststalker's Bindings to Mokvar.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="9796586ea7b1906176cbb37f2d7edc71e6d7e503338069f60998b7e05f4c0eef",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8915]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar spoke of Mux's interest in the samples, then offered the prospect of further exchanges from the same armor set.",["atomIDs"]={"8915:description:1-9","8915:description:12-84","8915:description:87-155","8915:description:160-258","8915:description:263-363","8915:description:366-440","8915:objective:1-124"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8915:completion:1-8","8915:completion:10-43","8915:completion:48-94","8915:completion:96-212"},["opening"]="Mokvar's proposed exchange joined a piece of Magister's armor to an errand in Silithus. Fifteen samples from its venomous creatures and twenty gold were his price for the trade.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to obtain the samples and offer the Magister's Bindings with the gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the venom and payment together with Magister's Bindings.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="262686f29e2aa66f8f1348d1d18b35ab49da3042549727ff2c243cf4316a41ae",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8916]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar accepted the delivery and disclosed that further help could make the remaining pieces of the set available.",["atomIDs"]={"8916:description:1-9","8916:description:12-84","8916:description:87-155","8916:description:160-258","8916:description:263-363","8916:description:366-440","8916:objective:1-119"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8916:completion:1-8","8916:completion:10-43","8916:completion:48-93","8916:completion:95-211"},["opening"]="The bracers Mokvar displayed were the first piece of a broader bargain. He would take Devout Bracers in trade once a supply of venom from Silithus and the required coins accompanied them.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring Mokvar the Devout Bracers, fifteen venom samples, and twenty gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled Mokvar's request for the bracers, samples, and gold.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="438585a5095601b52ee39895365114cd9b8d0eeae3dd40827ac679ac5326d8b8",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8917]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar anticipated Mux's satisfaction and left open a larger arrangement involving the rest of the armor set.",["atomIDs"]={"8917:description:1-9","8917:description:12-84","8917:description:87-155","8917:description:160-258","8917:description:263-363","8917:description:366-440","8917:objective:1-124"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8917:completion:1-8","8917:completion:10-43","8917:completion:48-93","8917:completion:95-211"},["opening"]="Mokvar needed venom from the spiders and scorpions of Silithus. A pair of Shadowcraft Bracers and twenty gold would complete the offer he wanted in return for his unusual armor.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to assemble the venom, coin, and Shadowcraft Bracers for the exchange.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the specified samples, gold, and Shadowcraft Bracers to Mokvar.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="291accf6b6a3fbdfdad7bb588dd7660dbdbc0edd44985dca362cf96feef99493",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8918]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar expected the old goblin to welcome the material. Further assistance, he said, could secure access to the rest of the set.",["atomIDs"]={"8918:description:1-9","8918:description:12-84","8918:description:87-155","8918:description:160-258","8918:description:263-363","8918:description:366-440","8918:objective:1-125"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8918:completion:1-8","8918:completion:10-62","8918:completion:67-113","8918:completion:115-230"},["opening"]="Bindings of Elements were the armor Mokvar wanted for his first exchange. He also asked for fifteen samples of Silithus venom and twenty gold before he would part with his own piece.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to supply the bindings, venom samples, and payment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Bindings of Elements with fifteen venom samples and twenty gold.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceConflicts"]={"Objective and description specify venom; completion calls the material blood. Narrative keeps the objective and does not resolve the terminology discrepancy."},["sourceHash"]="b6127913e9299aa69838671faf327742a0e05131ad2c2a40333750b16f1bb0f4",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8919]={["aftermath"]="The completed exchange led Mokvar to mention Mux and the other pieces he might offer for continued help.",["atomIDs"]={"8919:description:1-9","8919:description:12-84","8919:description:87-155","8919:description:160-258","8919:description:263-363","8919:description:366-440","8919:objective:1-122"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8919:completion:1-8","8919:completion:10-43","8919:completion:48-93","8919:completion:95-211"},["opening"]="Mokvar's offer for Dreadmist Bracers depended on an additional collection in Silithus. Its spiders and scorpions could supply the venom he wanted, while gold covered the remaining terms.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather the venom and carry it to Mokvar with the Dreadmist Bracers and gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied the bracers, fifteen venom samples, and twenty gold.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="afc56de8069f8e7c115aa6f0d10bc2b24db278f6eb6127943f0e9a803602754b",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
