[8921]={["aftermath"]="Mux accepted the materials and expected the distiller ready shortly. The collection phase remained ahead of the device's construction.",["atomIDs"]={"8921:description:1-42","8921:description:44-80","8921:description:83-131","8921:description:136-158","8921:description:161-170","8921:description:173-244","8921:description:247-306","8921:description:311-408","8921:description:410-503","8921:objective:1-151"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8921:completion:1-43","8921:completion:45-65","8921:completion:70-124","8921:completion:126-192"},["opening"]="Mux lacked funds and labor for his ghost-revealing invention. Its first device would harvest ectoplasm, requiring engineered parts, magical essences, oil and volcanic ash for a filter, along with forty gold.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring Mux the requested converter, essences, oil, ash and forty gold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered one Delicate Arcanite Converter, four Greater Eternal Essences, ten Stonescale Oils, twenty-five Volcanic Ash and forty gold to Mux.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="36cba9a1ce54ccd6f65dafcc432ff3a1645d0d0e7d199637fb72b18d9998faf4",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8922]={["atomIDs"]={"8922:description:1-49","8922:description:51-82","8922:description:87-150","8922:description:153-224","8922:description:229-342","8922:objective:1-82"},["opening"]="Deliana needed contact with Anthion Harmon's ghost. Mux claimed an engineering answer to communication with the dead, and the sealed blood was intended as payment for his services.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the Sealed Blood Container to Mux.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Sealed Blood Container to Mux Manascrambler.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="6603d756b4f48ae6688724e748edb3261cf3585d391f1b11139c7baa10a12252",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8923]={["atomIDs"]={"8923:description:1-56","8923:description:59-127","8923:description:130-210","8923:description:215-347","8923:description:350-434","8923:description:437-508","8923:objective:1-66"},["opening"]="Mokvar's hope of understanding his situation rested on speaking with Anthion. The venom samples were payment for Mux, whose new device was meant to open communication with the dead.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to deliver the Sealed Venom Container to Mux.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Sealed Venom Container to Mux Manascrambler.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="76e02983f22cb17a230ce35d3df756419211ad6bac1e675b0ae843f8b439791d",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8924]={["aftermath"]="The ectoplasm offered energies Mux believed could reach souls not yet departed. The different samples supplied the ghost-revealer project without themselves recording contact with a particular spirit.",["atomIDs"]={"8924:description:1-51","8924:description:54-147","8924:description:152-243","8924:description:246-441","8924:description:444-505","8924:objective:1-190","8924:objective:193-279"},["bridge"]="The distiller materials had reached Mux. His next work required three climates' ectoplasm, collected with the device placed near the incorporeal dead.",["bridgeFrom"]=8921,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8924:completion:1-25","8924:completion:30-187"},["opening"]="Mux expected climate to change the consistency of spectral remains. The distiller needed ectoplasm from Silithus, Winterspring and the Eastern Plaguelands to supply all three kinds for his project.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather twelve each of Scorched, Frozen and Stable Ectoplasm and return the distiller.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered twelve of each required ectoplasm type and the Ectoplasmic Distiller to Mux.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="3b866aefd3168768f20898dfed501a3a2971207f2c45f29ed919e5a362212bf9",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8925]={["aftermath"]="Mux judged the core sufficient to power his device. The energy source was secured, while assembly still had another requirement.",["atomIDs"]={"8925:description:1-95","8925:description:98-226","8925:description:231-308","8925:description:311-414","8925:objective:1-114"},["bridge"]="The ectoplasm had reached Mux. Keeping its energies active required a portable heat source, and Magma Lord Bokk's rumored magma heart offered one.",["bridgeFrom"]=8924,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8925:completion:1-15","8925:completion:17-107"},["opening"]="The stored ectoplasm needed a steady portable source of energy. Rumor placed such heat in Magma Lord Bokk's heart, a magma core within the Burning Steppes elemental.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover Bokk's Magma Core for Mux.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Magma Lord Bokk's Magma Core to Mux Manascrambler.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="9b37ef36a011258d885b2806f6f78a557a5f231f95d5ed2b7d741f0f449f5ea1",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8926]={["atomIDs"]={"8926:description:1-55","8926:description:58-136","8926:description:139-199","8926:description:202-262","8926:objective:1-74"},["opening"]="The ghost device had reached Deliana, and she promised compensation to keep help engaged in saving her. Wildheart gloves and belt were the equipment she offered to replace with finer pieces.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to give Deliana the Wildheart Belt and Wildheart Gloves.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Wildheart Belt and Wildheart Gloves to Deliana.",["sourceClassMask"]="1024",["sourceHash"]="292ea07ae0655a358567fa86b7a1b5f7694f6422cea7b1b316517fa5d0fc1c37",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8927]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar reaffirmed the agreement and promised greater rewards if he could be freed from his cursed fate.",["atomIDs"]={"8927:description:1-51","8927:description:54-185","8927:description:190-234","8927:description:237-317","8927:objective:1-76"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8927:completion:1-31","8927:completion:33-86","8927:completion:88-169"},["opening"]="Mokvar offered to exchange a Wildheart Belt and Gloves as the next installment of their agreement. The remaining armor still depended on help with his predicament.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the Wildheart Belt and Gloves for Mokvar's next exchange.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the Wildheart Belt and Gloves to Mokvar.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="a418289400ac7b260095557f46dd9c6e65e15e7cd9f87948a99745750b3b743b",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8928]={["aftermath"]="Mux accepted the rod as suitable and prepared to assemble the pieces. The finished spirit conversation remained beyond this delivery.",["atomIDs"]={"8928:description:1-141","8928:description:146-211","8928:description:214-261","8928:description:264-329","8928:description:334-393","8928:description:396-430","8928:description:435-506","8928:objective:1-169"},["bridge"]="Bokk's core had reached Mux, securing the power. A heat-resistant elemental rod from the Winterspring imp remained necessary to channel it safely.",["bridgeFrom"]=8925,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8928:completion:1-11","8928:completion:13-39","8928:completion:41-69"},["opening"]="The core supplied power, but Mux still needed a rod that would channel it without melting. An imp at Darkwhisper Gorge had offered a suitable elemental rod for forty gold, a price Mux wanted honored.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to purchase a Fel Elemental Rod from the Winterspring imp and return it to Mux.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the purchased Fel Elemental Rod to Mux Manascrambler.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="812e17fe836e874bcd7835cc881a981e58a2ca42f5d4af81c5eb72a9e8489ba7",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8929]={["aftermath"]="Anthion agreed to help Deliana's messenger but first asked a major favor.",["atomIDs"]={"8929:description:1-67","8929:description:70-176","8929:description:181-242","8929:objective:1-114"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8929:completion:1-27","8929:completion:29-99"},["opening"]="Deliana was ready to test the goblin's invention at Stratholme's entrance. Rumor placed Anthion's death there during his attempt to enter, offering a possible place to reach his ghost.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to use the revealer and seek Anthion.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} contacted Anthion's spirit.",["sourceHash"]="0acdd4919edd8cc26ee90dbcb34c49e40e1b5d031aa8d0e0f57722652a7f6299",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8930]={["aftermath"]="Anthion promised assistance to Mokvar's envoy after a favor of his own.",["atomIDs"]={"8930:description:1-14","8930:description:17-78","8930:description:81-182","8930:description:187-261","8930:objective:1-114"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8930:completion:1-26","8930:completion:28-98"},["opening"]="Mokvar sent the device toward the gates where Anthion was said to have fallen. Its test would determine whether the dead man could actually be contacted.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to reveal and speak with Anthion's ghost.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the spirit through the device.",["sourceHash"]="bf1dbc7d4ba350ffed26a846bdd00ff0befa46f45d8717bedaf37070e441f116",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
