[8939]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar kept his promise of further exchanges tied to escape from his cursed fate.",["atomIDs"]={"8939:description:1-51","8939:description:54-185","8939:description:190-234","8939:description:237-317","8939:objective:1-78"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8939:completion:1-31","8939:completion:33-86","8939:completion:88-169"},["opening"]="Mokvar was willing to trade for a Magister's Belt and Gloves. He treated the exchange as an installment, reserving the rest of the armor for further help.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to present the Magister's Belt and Gloves under Mokvar's agreement.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Magister's Belt and Gloves to Mokvar.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="0d7fe4c1bf147cfb9d6979ceb3b9e2e633093dd5e85c0e8da484f53730aa20ac",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8940]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar confirmed that their agreement continued, with greater rewards dependent on his release from the curse.",["atomIDs"]={"8940:description:1-51","8940:description:54-185","8940:description:190-234","8940:description:237-317","8940:objective:1-70"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8940:completion:1-31","8940:completion:33-86","8940:completion:88-169"},["opening"]="A Devout Belt and Gloves were the next pieces Mokvar would accept. His larger offer remained bound to the assistance he still needed.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to provide the Devout Belt and Gloves for the exchange.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Mokvar with the Devout Belt and Gloves.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="c133fd8aac99ecaf71861494524d699702e07092da9a811a2d9cdb93dec02bf8",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8941]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar again pledged more powerful items if the cursed fate could be lifted from him.",["atomIDs"]={"8941:description:1-51","8941:description:54-185","8941:description:190-234","8941:description:237-317","8941:objective:1-80"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8941:completion:1-31","8941:completion:33-86","8941:completion:88-169"},["opening"]="Mokvar's agreement had reached the Shadowcraft Belt and Gloves. He was prepared to exchange these pieces while the larger task continued.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring the Shadowcraft Belt and Gloves to Mokvar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the Shadowcraft Belt and Gloves for Mokvar's exchange.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="dcf39a3b418c07612fefe8837d7b44b891af9f345dd070f1d754af095f0718f1",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8942]={["aftermath"]="The bargain remained in force, and Mokvar still promised greater compensation for freedom from the curse.",["atomIDs"]={"8942:description:1-51","8942:description:54-185","8942:description:190-237","8942:description:240-320","8942:objective:1-83"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8942:completion:1-31","8942:completion:33-86","8942:completion:88-169"},["opening"]="Mokvar offered the next trade for a Cord and Gauntlets of Elements. The exchange acknowledged work already done while leaving the rest of his armor tied to further assistance.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to deliver the Cord of Elements and Gauntlets of Elements.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the cord and gauntlets to Mokvar.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="e0927fb6e73fbb564a9de0a413a7b47c2706e7072366c5956208455ec7ab7b48",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8943]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar upheld their arrangement and linked its greater rewards to release from his cursed fate.",["atomIDs"]={"8943:description:1-51","8943:description:54-185","8943:description:190-234","8943:description:237-317","8943:objective:1-75"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8943:completion:1-31","8943:completion:33-86","8943:completion:88-169"},["opening"]="The Dreadmist Belt and Wraps were due under Mokvar's next offer. His predicament remained unresolved, and later pieces would depend on seeing it through.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the Dreadmist Belt and Wraps to Mokvar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Dreadmist Belt and Wraps for the agreed exchange.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="56fb19c2c4bfba0aabe28f244868cc68916395c9730dcc79fe7df79b559c2ea5",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8944]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar confirmed the continuing agreement and renewed his promise of more powerful items for an end to the curse.",["atomIDs"]={"8944:description:1-51","8944:description:54-185","8944:description:190-237","8944:description:240-320","8944:objective:1-77"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8944:completion:1-31","8944:completion:33-86","8944:completion:88-169"},["opening"]="Mokvar was ready to exchange a Belt and Gauntlets of Valor. He regarded the trade as one step toward a larger settlement if his predicament could be resolved.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to provide the Belt of Valor and Gauntlets of Valor.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the belt and gauntlets to Mokvar.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="820be97d59fa7abc834a41051a6541a85df0c9e77af623fbb0a70fc8f78af57f",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8945]={["aftermath"]="Ysida offered thanks for her rescue, then faltered at the news concerning Anthion. Her freedom did not erase the loss behind his plea.",["atomIDs"]={"8945:description:1-49","8945:description:52-89","8945:description:94-160","8945:description:165-271","8945:description:274-366","8945:objective:1-64"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8945:completion:1-28","8945:completion:30-50","8945:completion:52-103","8945:completion:108-120","8945:completion:128-141"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Rescue Ysida Harmon from Baron Rivendare in Stratholme.",["opening"]="Anthion put the promised information aside when his wife's captivity became urgent. He had opposed Ysida joining the Argent Dawn, but now wanted someone to finish his own failed attempt to save her from Rivendare.",["pending"]="{actor} would enter Stratholme to rescue Ysida.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} freed Ysida Harmon from Rivendare's forces.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="8cb38f70c031caace3679959bb95156e6bfc5794884250a533f01bf9d663ab5c",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8946]={["aftermath"]="Anthion recognized that she had been found and agreed to answer questions before his remaining time ended.",["atomIDs"]={"8946:description:1-83","8946:description:86-144","8946:description:149-194","8946:description:197-268","8946:description:273-285","8946:description:288-318","8946:objective:1-62"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8946:completion:1-14","8946:completion:16-29","8946:completion:31-63","8946:completion:68-119","8946:completion:121-170"},["opening"]="Ysida learned that Anthion died trying to save her. Her locket would carry proof of her survival to the man whose spirit still lingered, so he could finally rest.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Ysida's locket to Anthion.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the proof of her safety.",["sourceHash"]="8364d22d722e9aa0a2315f56e5aa254c2a78278acbd63c3a89e862cac712afdf",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8947]={["aftermath"]="Anthion prepared to transmute them into a form suited to the plan.",["atomIDs"]={"8947:description:1-111","8947:description:114-165","8947:description:168-240","8947:description:243-287","8947:description:292-362","8947:description:365-438","8947:description:443-480","8947:description:483-508","8947:objective:1-128"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8947:completion:1-10","8947:completion:12-77"},["opening"]="Valthalak's medallion had been divided as ordinary loot before its importance was understood. Theldren, who held one piece, had become a Dark Iron gladiator; Anthion required materials before arranging a confrontation.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather Anthion's metal, leather, cloth and hides.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered all four materials.",["sourceHash"]="cd5426ea512674994c3f0905e4891c4a9364a38c15d6910a391b88c78f69bf21",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8948]={["aftermath"]="Falrin recognized the old acquaintance's name and agreed to hear what was wanted.",["atomIDs"]={"8948:description:1-61","8948:description:64-116","8948:description:121-216","8948:description:221-296","8948:description:299-327","8948:description:329-347","8948:description:350-396","8948:objective:1-91"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8948:completion:1-26","8948:completion:28-49","8948:completion:51-96","8948:completion:101-116","8948:completion:119-164"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring Anthion's unfinished banner to Falrin in Dire Maul's library.",["opening"]="Theldren would not willingly accept a fair contest. Anthion had prepared a banner in the fighter's family colors, but Falrin's skill at provocation was needed to enchant it into an irresistible challenge.",["pending"]="{actor} would take the banner to Falrin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Anthion's unfinished banner to Falrin.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="f8b0fd29126e5a7827afa411b19e83204d375d42261b3d98a8237f028c01d9c3",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8949]={["aftermath"]="The killings had not eased Falrin's grief for his brother, but he acknowledged the bargain had been met.",["atomIDs"]={"8949:description:1-73","8949:description:76-162","8949:description:167-236","8949:description:239-340","8949:description:345-368","8949:description:371-388","8949:description:391-460","8949:description:463-507","8949:objective:1-138"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8949:completion:1-7","8949:completion:9-103","8949:completion:108-146","8949:completion:148-179"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Collect twenty-five ogre warbeads for Falrin.",["opening"]="Falrin would not enchant the banner for friendship alone. His hatred of both Gordok and Omokk's ogres made their warbeads the price of his help, a demand rooted in a loss he had not explained at first.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather ogre warbeads from Dire Maul or Blackrock Spire.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Falrin the twenty-five warbeads.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="2ca1f7200b5b037f242c1999d6c3de4d9f397f99f3ac3406e6eb14ffe136a47c",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8950]={["aftermath"]="Falrin accepted the materials and promised a challenge its target would be unable to resist.",["atomIDs"]={"8950:description:1-71","8950:description:74-183","8950:description:188-335","8950:description:338-399","8950:objective:1-130"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8950:completion:1-29","8950:completion:31-131"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring Falrin a jeering spectre's essence, four dark runes and eight brilliant shards.",["opening"]="Falrin knew the rare enchantment needed for the banner but lacked its reagents. An Eldreth ghost's essence, Scholomance runes and enchanting shards would give Anthion's provocation the force it required.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather the reagents for Falrin's enchantment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Falrin with the essence, runes and shards.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="0c4508847ff428cd2c50670055fb85477eb79155adc7b62cb89e53223accd32e",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8951]={["atomIDs"]={"8951:description:1-43","8951:description:46-140","8951:description:145-221","8951:description:224-316","8951:description:319-369","8951:description:374-406","8951:description:409-468","8951:objective:1-103"},["opening"]="Anthion confessed that greed had led the group to split Valthalak's soul-bearing amulet. Reassembly was the only answer he knew, and Bodley the hope for its lost parts; Wildheart boots, kilt and spaulders accompanied the return to Deliana.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to report Anthion's counsel and bring the three specified Wildheart pieces to Deliana.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Deliana with the Wildheart Boots, Kilt and Spaulders required by the assignment.",["sourceClassMask"]="1024",["sourceHash"]="6546256571e7677b990e92dce137024060b335649835db20135b15264b08d709",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8952]={["atomIDs"]={"8952:description:1-43","8952:description:46-140","8952:description:145-221","8952:description:224-316","8952:description:319-369","8952:description:374-406","8952:description:409-468","8952:objective:1-114"},["opening"]="The amulet's three-way division had brought a curse its owners had not foreseen. Anthion sent that explanation and Bodley's name back with a return involving Beaststalker boots, pants and mantle.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take Anthion's message and the specified Beaststalker pieces to Deliana.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the return to Deliana with Beaststalker's Boots, Pants and Mantle.",["sourceClassMask"]="4",["sourceHash"]="96579f324e9723bbf38e524d88bc6f2da5c82f0301823c3d8abc2a4bbf3d347b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8953]={["atomIDs"]={"8953:description:1-43","8953:description:46-140","8953:description:145-221","8953:description:224-316","8953:description:319-369","8953:description:374-406","8953:description:409-468","8953:objective:1-105"},["opening"]="Anthion's account made the scattered medallion the means of undoing Valthalak's spell. His own hope of rest left Deliana dependent on Bodley, while Magister boots, leggings and mantle formed the requested armor turn-in.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to return to Deliana with Anthion's counsel and the three Magister pieces.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Magister's Boots, Leggings and Mantle to Deliana on Anthion's return assignment.",["sourceClassMask"]="128",["sourceHash"]="dd697a5d50edea211f79f0e8e7195a32e3c1c66acd2ba409934e85b668bf22e2",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8954]={["atomIDs"]={"8954:description:1-43","8954:description:46-140","8954:description:145-221","8954:description:224-316","8954:description:319-369","8954:description:374-406","8954:description:409-468","8954:objective:1-109"},["opening"]="Anthion no longer separated the curse from the group's greed. He urged restoring the soul-bearing amulet through Bodley's help and sent the next compensation claim to Deliana with Lightforge boots, legplates and spaulders.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring the named Lightforge pieces and Anthion's message to Deliana.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Deliana's turn-in of Lightforge Boots, Legplates and Spaulders.",["sourceClassMask"]="2",["sourceHash"]="d1f7be2461cabaf840e080337b9aa2ea29a392b8e34f7e21fbcbe302d8ca0da6",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8955]={["atomIDs"]={"8955:description:1-43","8955:description:46-140","8955:description:145-221","8955:description:224-316","8955:description:319-369","8955:description:374-406","8955:description:409-468","8955:objective:1-92"},["opening"]="The departing spirit offered one clear direction: the amulet had to be whole, and Bodley could help locate what remained. Devout sandals, skirt and mantle were to return with that warning to Deliana.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to report Anthion's words and deliver the three Devout pieces.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Deliana with Devout Sandals, Skirt and Mantle.",["sourceClassMask"]="16",["sourceHash"]="8608dcef143a6a4f2799cef5d73c0c5c33180b36b52b9cd5e777390029468197",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8956]={["atomIDs"]={"8956:description:1-43","8956:description:46-140","8956:description:145-221","8956:description:224-316","8956:description:319-369","8956:description:374-406","8956:description:409-468","8956:objective:1-108"},["opening"]="Dividing Valthalak's amulet had divided his soul without foreseeing the spell that followed. Anthion left the living to restore it, directing Shadowcraft boots, pants and spaulders back to Deliana alongside his counsel.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to return to Deliana with the specified Shadowcraft armor and Anthion's message.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the return with Shadowcraft Boots, Pants and Spaulders.",["sourceClassMask"]="8",["sourceHash"]="d7b9a6db35200879d8d0be03a53b0d9a2a0ca67323ba1728100094293e64fd1a",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8957]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar recoiled at the cost of the medallion and asked whether Anthion had truly named Bodley. He then turned to the agreed compensation.",["atomIDs"]={"8957:description:1-43","8957:description:46-140","8957:description:145-218","8957:description:221-312","8957:description:315-365","8957:description:370-402","8957:description:405-464","8957:objective:1-105"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8957:completion:1-80","8957:completion:82-122","8957:completion:127-193"},["opening"]="Anthion traced the curse to Valthalak's amulet, broken into three pieces by the mercenaries' greed. Bodley was Mokvar's hope of finding the missing pieces; the message was to accompany the next Elements armor exchange.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take Anthion's warning and the boots, kilt, and pauldrons to Mokvar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Mokvar with Anthion's message and the requested Elements armor.",["sharedMechanism"]="Class-specific armor alternatives preserve the same sourced exchange; each branch requires its own listed armor.",["sourceHash"]="1ef590450b4525cf9dee2a1bff4cf51175de1b2528886a43a74feb914b58683c",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8958]={["atomIDs"]={"8958:description:1-43","8958:description:46-140","8958:description:145-221","8958:description:224-316","8958:description:319-369","8958:description:374-406","8958:description:409-468","8958:objective:1-104"},["opening"]="Anthion hoped finally to rest while the amulet's pieces remained the living group's task. He named Bodley as Deliana's hope of finding them and sent the return through a Dreadmist armor exchange.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring Dreadmist Sandals, Leggings and Mantle to Deliana with the counsel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Dreadmist Sandals, Leggings and Mantle to Deliana on the return assignment.",["sourceClassMask"]="256",["sourceHash"]="83f7b360da3474b5a3848497ab166f131ff89c12861eb8be6d2ba3ad5c77171f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8959]={["atomIDs"]={"8959:description:1-43","8959:description:46-140","8959:description:145-221","8959:description:224-316","8959:description:319-369","8959:description:374-406","8959:description:409-468","8959:objective:1-103"},["opening"]="Bodley's knowledge offered a path to repairing the medallion that the group's greed had broken. Anthion directed the report back to Deliana, with Valor boots, legplates and spaulders for the arranged reward.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to return Anthion's message with the three named Valor pieces.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Deliana with Boots of Valor, Legplates of Valor and Spaulders of Valor.",["sourceClassMask"]="1",["sourceHash"]="6708e72f970c11fb591c1cf54367c67c8846db325e9568f98c9bd7f178757a4e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8960]={["aftermath"]="Bodley asked for help undoing his company's theft and offered a way to recover the amulet's other fragments.",["atomIDs"]={"8960:description:1-48","8960:description:51-99","8960:description:102-195","8960:description:200-304","8960:objective:1-110"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8960:completion:1-33","8960:completion:35-61","8960:completion:66-86","8960:completion:88-154","8960:completion:156-359","8960:completion:364-404","8960:completion:406-422"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Use the ghost revealer to find Bodley near Blackrock Spire.",["opening"]="Bodley had vanished after setting out to re-enter the Spire. The search for the remaining medallion pieces therefore had to allow for his death, with the goblin device offering a way to find him even as a ghost.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek Bodley with the ghost revealer.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Bodley's ghost near the Spire.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="52365c4d2a2b121df9488cca32345e2c48daeae30893d552476fa1a42fa9a023",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8961]={["aftermath"]="The vessel could now burn, but it still needed a personal focus to call a particular spirit.",["atomIDs"]={"8961:description:1-105","8961:description:107-179","8961:description:184-344","8961:description:346-507","8961:objective:1-170"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8961:completion:1-47","8961:completion:49-173","8961:completion:178-262"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring Bodley remains from three fire nobles and a hallowed brazier.",["opening"]="Calling the dead mercenaries required a brazier and coals powerful enough to sustain it. Bodley named Incendius, Emberseer and the Duke of Cynders as the three fiery sources needed before any amulet fragment could be summoned.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather the fire nobles' remains and the hallowed brazier.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the brazier and three fiery components to Bodley.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="f8601570b43320a8013e8f4354b00a877a12328fc999854866dc994e0a140d81",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8962]={["aftermath"]="Bodley imbued the brazier and directed Mor's summons to Voone's chamber in Tazz'Alaor. The fragment had to be taken before his old comrade could rest.",["atomIDs"]={"8962:description:1-19","8962:description:21-231","8962:description:236-369","8962:description:371-499","8962:objective:1-78"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8962:completion:1-20","8962:completion:22-78","8962:completion:83-305","8962:completion:307-362"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover druidical remains from the silithid near Hive'Regal for Bodley.",["opening"]="Mor Grayhoof had friends in the Cenarion Circle who had fallen to Silithus's insects. Their remains would furnish a personal focus strong enough to draw his corrupted spirit to Bodley's brazier.",["pending"]="{actor} would recover the remains from the silithid around Hive'Regal.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the druidical remains to Bodley.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="4c7c0f727f6783756ef79d5272182647feb264aa6ba000af98067794cd96aa53",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8963]={["aftermath"]="Bodley prepared the focus and directed the summons to the Shrine of Eldretharr in eastern Dire Maul.",["atomIDs"]={"8963:description:1-19","8963:description:21-231","8963:description:236-305","8963:description:307-485","8963:objective:1-85"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8963:completion:1-20","8963:completion:22-76","8963:completion:81-245","8963:completion:247-368"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring Bodley a Starbreeze relic taken from Frostwhisper Gorge's giants.",["opening"]="Isalien had grown up in Starbreeze Village. A relic carried away by Frostmaul raiders could connect the brazier to her past and draw the priestess's spirit, still corrupted by Valthalak's amulet fragment.",["pending"]="{actor} would recover a Starbreeze relic from the Frostmaul giants.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the village relic to Bodley.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="8ca11256fdbfb36cf4af9d4a080e063be70d38feb9ef55f5d4e563f2c5b29649",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8964]={["aftermath"]="Bodley imbued the brazier for a summons at the Crimson Throne in Stratholme, where the siblings' souls had been twisted by the amulet.",["atomIDs"]={"8964:description:1-19","8964:description:21-233","8964:description:238-319","8964:description:321-377","8964:description:379-488","8964:objective:1-89"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8964:completion:1-20","8964:completion:22-76","8964:completion:81-265","8964:completion:267-374"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover a brilliant zealot's sword from Tyr's Hand for Bodley.",["opening"]="Jarien and Sothos had aspired to knighthood in the Scarlet Crusade. A praetorian's sword from Tyr's Hand would furnish a focus tied to that ambition, allowing the brazier to call the siblings' remains.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek the sword among Tyr's Hand's praetorians.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the sword to Bodley.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="eeca6bd46ea4abb400be0c308c6aa19d8bee983ff083866f573f781ae3c5121d",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8965]={["aftermath"]="Bodley prepared the brazier for Kormok's spirit in Ras Frostwhisper's chamber, warning that the amulet had deepened his corruption.",["atomIDs"]={"8965:description:1-19","8965:description:21-231","8965:description:236-412","8965:description:414-486","8965:objective:1-86"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8965:completion:1-20","8965:completion:22-76","8965:completion:81-235","8965:completion:237-374"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Gather ashes of Purgation Isle's banished dead for Bodley.",["opening"]="Kormok had delighted in summoning the banished souls on Purgation Isle. Ashes from those dead would make a focus connected to the necromancer, allowing Bodley to prepare a summons strong enough to reclaim the amulet fragment.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather the banished souls' ashes.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the ashes to Bodley.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="453d8acd4039c83cdd33a933da1958460cc8c25df61b237f95596b793bcbb39c",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8966]={["aftermath"]="Bodley hoped the spirit could now rest, but needed divination to locate the next fragment's bearer.",["atomIDs"]={"8966:description:1-159","8966:description:161-273","8966:description:275-334","8966:description:339-439","8966:description:441-511","8966:objective:1-85","8966:objective:87-205"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8966:completion:1-32","8966:completion:34-140","8966:completion:145-261","8966:completion:263-419"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Summon Mor Grayhoof and recover his amulet fragment for Bodley.",["opening"]="Mor fell into the lower Spire during the company's flight after stealing Valthalak's possessions. He survived only to be tortured by Voone and murdered by spectral assassins, leaving the stolen fragment bound to a corrupted spirit.",["pending"]="{actor} would call Mor's spirit and recover the fragment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned Mor Grayhoof's fragment and the brazier to Bodley.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="f3994a4347d3b49ddc85cfe33f5a64ce025b22b31b918602d9ae19414dac8bba",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8967]={["aftermath"]="Bodley hoped the spirit could now rest, but needed divination to locate the next fragment's bearer.",["atomIDs"]={"8967:description:1-209","8967:description:211-363","8967:description:368-400","8967:description:402-511","8967:objective:1-80","8967:objective:82-200"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8967:completion:1-52","8967:completion:54-104","8967:completion:106-220","8967:completion:225-341","8967:completion:343-499"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Summon Isalien in Dire Maul and recover her amulet fragment.",["opening"]="Isalien sought personal answers and the stolen amulet's secrets in the ancestral city now called Dire Maul. Bodley reported that Alzzin's forces ambushed her at Eldretharr's shrine, leaving her spirit to be summoned for the fragment.",["pending"]="{actor} would summon Isalien and recover her fragment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Isalien's fragment and the brazier back to Bodley.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="3d5f6195f66a7f41965903fb95bcaac1ff2cae819db40b21b5fb31a2d94bd821",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8968]={["aftermath"]="Bodley accepted that the souls had been put to rest, then turned to divination because the next fragment's location remained unknown.",["atomIDs"]={"8968:description:1-114","8968:description:116-177","8968:description:179-228","8968:description:233-395","8968:description:400-417","8968:description:419-492","8968:objective:1-77","8968:objective:79-197"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8968:completion:1-136","8968:completion:138-214","8968:completion:219-335","8968:completion:337-493"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Summon Jarien and Sothos and recover the left amulet fragment.",["opening"]="After the mercenary company dissolved, Jarien and Sothos took their fragment and attempted to join the Scarlet Crusade. Bodley's reports said Dathrohan killed them for failing the initiation, leaving the piece to be recovered by calling their spirits.",["pending"]="{actor} would summon the siblings in the Scarlet Bastion.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the siblings' amulet fragment and the brazier to Bodley.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="a4ce41066ce77e8c5b0d86faf1df323cc6e141449a12b63d65de61f0494a65b1",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8969]={["aftermath"]="Bodley hoped Kormok could rest, then turned to divination because the location of the next fragment's bearer remained unknown.",["atomIDs"]={"8969:description:1-85","8969:description:90-155","8969:description:157-224","8969:description:226-328","8969:description:333-421","8969:description:423-483","8969:objective:1-79","8969:objective:81-199"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8969:completion:1-14","8969:completion:16-138","8969:completion:140-175","8969:completion:180-296","8969:completion:298-454"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Summon Kormok in Scholomance and recover the left amulet fragment for Bodley.",["opening"]="Kormok's turn to necromancy had unsettled his former companions. He took an amulet fragment to Scholomance, where spectral assassins killed him before Ras Frostwhisper; Bodley's brazier offered a means to call him back and reclaim it.",["pending"]="{actor} would summon Kormok's spirit and recover the fragment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned Kormok's amulet fragment and the brazier to Bodley.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="eb23d0899c07b0e353132f7054e1d1cb11b2a359121f2b42f37ed94ca27318f2",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8970]={["aftermath"]="Bodley began the divination with a warning that accurate answers required more than a moment's effort.",["atomIDs"]={"8970:description:1-74","8970:description:76-213","8970:description:215-344","8970:description:349-378","8970:description:380-507","8970:objective:1-95"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8970:completion:1-62","8970:completion:64-135","8970:completion:140-167","8970:completion:169-264"},["opening"]="Bodley's former interest in divination offered a way to locate the final amulet piece and a lost comrade's spirit. Bloodkelp from Alcaz was the rare reagent he needed.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather twenty Bloodkelp for Bodley.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the Bloodkelp to Blackrock Mountain.",["sourceHash"]="9d5dcbcee7cd01c50c27b3a1658d3ce035cb7722bf178b3277ce64f5f4f3b1f7",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8977]={["aftermath"]="Deliana accepted the ghost revealer despite doubting its goblin craftsmanship. Her lack of alternatives made the device necessary to the next part of the effort.",["atomIDs"]={"8977:description:1-37","8977:description:40-68","8977:description:73-118","8977:description:121-169","8977:description:172-209","8977:objective:1-68"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8977:completion:1-10","8977:completion:12-32","8977:completion:34-116"},["opening"]="Mux's finished ghost revealer was ready for its purpose beyond Gadgetzan. He sent it to Deliana and hoped the completed work might bring more customers to his shop.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer to Deliana.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer to Deliana.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="6eb7560556a19109a50c4e4d9e795c007b8a7c9bbd70333bcb504af4922cb55a",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8978]={["aftermath"]="Mokvar welcomed the device and praised the dedication behind its delivery.",["atomIDs"]={"8978:description:1-37","8978:description:40-68","8978:description:73-118","8978:description:121-169","8978:description:172-209","8978:objective:1-72"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8978:completion:1-32","8978:completion:34-70","8978:completion:72-86"},["opening"]="Mux had finished the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer. The device was ready to return to Mokvar, while its maker hoped that word of his work would bring more customers.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry the completed Ghost Revealer to Mokvar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Mux's finished Ghost Revealer to Mokvar.",["sourceHash"]="dfd54924f3eb6b07ae334658bb8765323e9495ffea3e728da3081695a239063f",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8979]={["aftermath"]="Zinge initially dismissed the inquiry as another of Fenstad's obsessions but agreed to examine the samples.",["atomIDs"]={"8979:description:1-51","8979:description:53-129","8979:description:131-188","8979:description:193-243","8979:description:248-351","8979:description:353-401","8979:description:406-462","8979:objective:1-96"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8979:completion:1-43","8979:completion:45-159","8979:completion:164-202"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Take a bottle each of cologne and perfume to Apothecary Zinge.",["opening"]="Fenstad suspected that fashionable fragrances concealed alchemy capable of clouding thought. Zinge's analysis could test the suspicion instead of leaving the apparent epidemic of love to rumor.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring both fragrances to Zinge.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the bottles to the Apothecarium.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="01b778a213a719758e7ffd2bc25d3b073e96f99f24526cc37d3622169228c4aa",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8980]={["aftermath"]="Fenstad reimbursed the purchase and urged an immediate search for the supplier.",["atomIDs"]={"8980:description:1-19","8980:description:21-77","8980:description:79-136","8980:description:141-237","8980:description:239-327","8980:objective:1-59"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8980:completion:1-16","8980:completion:18-39","8980:completion:41-97","8980:completion:102-164"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Report Zinge's findings to Fenstad.",["opening"]="The fragrances contained traces associated with mind-control draughts, including ingredients Zinge considered unusually sophisticated. Her reluctant inquiry had uncovered a reason to take Fenstad's fear seriously.",["pending"]="{actor} would report the alchemical findings to Fenstad.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Zinge's assessment to Fenstad.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="b6f2b664a2018f9d6246b0b6e5e0ac4998eef6620e46f5d9de28a7b4572e3212",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8982]={["aftermath"]="Norman confirmed that the new stock was selling so quickly he could scarcely keep it available.",["atomIDs"]={"8982:description:1-33","8982:description:35-111","8982:description:113-173","8982:objective:1-45"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8982:completion:1-66","8982:completion:68-159","8982:completion:164-211"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Ask Innkeeper Norman about the fragrance supply.",["opening"]="Fenstad had seen Katrina carrying the perfume and learned that she bought it from Norman. The innkeeper was the next link between the fashionable bottles and whoever made them.",["pending"]="{actor} would question Norman about the fragrances.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Innkeeper Norman.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="e036f81b673bc6d23e5e6dfd5b32fc52c5894b2e671fa43720c3c9e02424c7f8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8983]={["aftermath"]="Mara said the entire supply had gone to Norman and redirected would-be buyers to his inn.",["atomIDs"]={"8983:description:1-34","8983:description:36-99","8983:description:104-157","8983:description:159-176","8983:description:181-266","8983:objective:1-77"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8983:completion:1-83","8983:completion:85-157","8983:completion:162-198","8983:completion:200-245"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Find Mara Rennick at the Mage Quarter's tailor.",["opening"]="Norman had bought his stock from a newcomer, Mara Rennick, who also mentioned a delivery to the tailor. Tracing the bottles now meant following that merchant rather than treating the inn as their source.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek Mara at the tailor's shop.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} questioned Mara Rennick about her stock.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="5b6d00dbad1e055cf282290bb4baa785c2c8ae73f19767da20302e055d3cdbce",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8984]={["aftermath"]="Staffron admitted creating the fragrances to weaken both armies with obsessive affection, leaving them unprepared for the Shadow Council's rise.",["atomIDs"]={"8984:description:1-59","8984:description:61-153","8984:description:158-212","8984:description:217-270","8984:description:272-353","8984:description:355-407","8984:objective:1-81"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8984:completion:1-29","8984:completion:31-56","8984:completion:58-70","8984:completion:75-223","8984:completion:228-261","8984:completion:263-324","8984:completion:329-355","8984:completion:357-399","8984:completion:401-441","8984:completion:443-497"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Find Staffron Lerent beyond Ravenholdt Manor.",["opening"]="Mara identified Staffron Lerent as the apothecary who had sold her the fragrances. His secluded workplace beyond Ravenholdt provided the next lead, though her unease was not itself proof of his guilt.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek Staffron in the Hillsbrad hills.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Staffron Lerent beyond Ravenholdt.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="43bd0a3712e1cbf3d57eb4e86a2963b8aa4d03bdd8437baaedb77190b570ed91",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
